# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Mixed endings arrived from editing CRLF files with LF-writing tools, which
# produces files that are half one and half the other and diffs that are mostly
# noise. Storing LF and letting git convert on checkout removes the class.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.hex binary
*.ioc text
*.tar.gz binary
